    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medusa is sat relaxing in the Temple of Ares when soldiers storm in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Athena, having decided Medusa's curse wasn't severe enough, sent her followers to get her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medusa must use her curse and her wits to her advantage to evade capture and punish the bratty goddess that betrayed her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based stealth puzzle gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden from sight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies to stone when it suits you, don't let them block your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to block vision from other enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let them get you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and stylised art style, with beautiful minimalist tilesets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of puzzles, ranging from simple to mind bending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual difficulty, even the hardest puzzles can be beaten with trial and error.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487590/extras/e05c97200c0cc6a8cef83e859a912587.avif?t=1740458313\" width=506 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medusa is sat relaxing in the Temple of Ares when soldiers storm in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Athena, having decided Medusa's curse wasn't severe enough, sent her followers to get her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medusa must use her curse and her wits to her advantage to evade capture and punish the bratty goddess that betrayed her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based stealth puzzle gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden from sight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemies to stone when it suits you, don't let them block your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to block vision from other enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let them get you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and stylised art style, with beautiful minimalist tilesets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of puzzles, ranging from simple to mind bending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual difficulty, even the hardest puzzles can be beaten with trial and error.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487590/extras/e05c97200c0cc6a8cef83e859a912587.avif?t=1740458313\" width=506 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
